# .env.example and .env.testing are the two intentional exceptions — both
# tracked on purpose. .env.testing carries zero secrets (just
# outbound-notification kill-switches for the test suite) and must ship
# with the repo so CI and every contributor get the same safe test
# behavior.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.testing
